WEBVTT

01:25.960 --> 01:31.580
[The Ingenious One]

01:33.210 --> 01:39.569
[Episode 31: The Devilish Trick]

01:40.800 --> 01:45.410
[Shao's Residence]

01:46.250 --> 01:46.926
In this way,

01:46.950 --> 01:49.316
I cut off the cash flow of Mo Bufan

01:49.340 --> 01:51.789
and destroyed Guanghui Bank.

01:52.200 --> 01:54.036
The rumor spread.

01:54.060 --> 01:56.420
The reputation of the Su family was ruined.

01:56.550 --> 02:00.259
I think no merchants in Nandu dare to cooperate with them now.

02:01.010 --> 02:02.460
Wonderful.

02:03.530 --> 02:04.750
It is said that merchants in Nandu

02:04.750 --> 02:06.056
are very smart.

02:06.080 --> 02:07.920
But when compared to you,

02:08.710 --> 02:10.410
they are all dwarfed.

02:11.340 --> 02:14.000
Should we think about what to do

02:14.430 --> 02:17.350
with the royal supplier selection?

02:17.710 --> 02:19.096
Exactly.

02:19.120 --> 02:21.676
But there is a problem.

02:21.700 --> 02:22.680
I wanted to take this opportunity to buy

02:22.700 --> 02:25.636
the Su family's craftsmanship of silk organza.

02:25.660 --> 02:27.026
Unexpectedly, Su Mingyu

02:27.050 --> 02:28.466
was too resistant

02:28.490 --> 02:30.020
to hand it over.

02:30.760 --> 02:32.450
Then this should be

02:32.710 --> 02:35.210
a piece of cake for you.

02:36.680 --> 02:38.780
I have a plan.

02:39.010 --> 02:43.060
But I need your help.

02:44.460 --> 02:47.336
The Su family is still hanging on

02:47.360 --> 02:49.806
because it has many businesses under its name.

02:49.830 --> 02:51.576
It can regain its cash flow sooner or later.

02:51.600 --> 02:53.876
All we need is an order from the government

02:53.900 --> 02:55.930
that uses rectifying the market order as a pretext,

02:56.480 --> 02:58.586
forcing the Su family to close its businesses.

02:58.610 --> 03:00.286
I believe within half a month,

03:00.310 --> 03:02.470
the Su family will collapse.

03:05.460 --> 03:09.940
Do you know the current situation

03:10.340 --> 03:12.430
for the government and for me?

03:13.690 --> 03:15.140
I know a little.

03:16.210 --> 03:18.000
I'm walking a tightrope.

03:18.150 --> 03:20.590
Last time I asked for the two imperial decrees for you

03:20.610 --> 03:22.290
to suppress the Su family.

03:22.350 --> 03:25.550
It triggered a lot of criticism.

03:26.180 --> 03:27.206
Sorry for implicating you

03:27.230 --> 03:28.690
because of my incompetence.

03:30.400 --> 03:31.336
Get up.

03:31.360 --> 03:32.810
Get up.

03:32.940 --> 03:34.420
Get up.

03:34.990 --> 03:36.636
It's because of the changes of the situation

03:36.660 --> 03:38.620
but not you.

03:39.670 --> 03:42.246
It's just that we need to stay as far away as possible from

03:42.270 --> 03:43.476
all the government departments

03:43.500 --> 03:45.695
and the Weaving Division.

03:45.719 --> 03:46.846
I understand.

03:46.870 --> 03:50.876
In fact, the Su family is barely afloat.

03:50.900 --> 03:52.350
One more strike can tear it down.

03:52.870 --> 03:54.426
However, although Dafeng Bank

03:54.450 --> 03:56.340
still has 400,000 taels in the treasury,

03:56.530 --> 03:59.476
I have to be prepared for Mo Bufan's counterattack.

03:59.500 --> 04:01.040
So I can't use this money for now.

04:01.100 --> 04:03.190
Therefore, please allow me

04:03.370 --> 04:06.446
to mobilize money from Yangzhou

04:06.470 --> 04:08.150
to prepare for the royal supplier selection.

04:09.480 --> 04:10.936
How much do you need?

04:10.960 --> 04:12.870
Since it's a duel with the Su family,

04:12.940 --> 04:14.366
I've decided to win over silk providers and weavers

04:14.390 --> 04:16.549
in Nandu with a high price

04:16.610 --> 04:18.780
so that Su Mingyu can find no one to use.

04:19.870 --> 04:21.515
Plus, we need money for connections.

04:21.539 --> 04:23.560
I need more than 150,000 taels.

04:27.670 --> 04:30.176
For things concerning money, you can be in charge.

04:30.200 --> 04:33.050
But it involves a large amount of money.

04:33.420 --> 04:36.656
I hope you can keep a low profile

04:36.680 --> 04:38.600
so that there won't be any gossip.

04:38.650 --> 04:41.196
What should I do?

04:41.220 --> 04:43.500
Please give me some advice.

04:43.610 --> 04:45.676
Why don't you sort out

04:45.700 --> 04:47.186
all your businesses in Yangzhou

04:47.210 --> 04:50.286
and gather all the spare money

04:50.310 --> 04:52.346
of each business.

04:52.370 --> 04:57.436
In this way, it won't disturb the business of Yangzhou

04:57.460 --> 05:01.370
or attract the attention of the merchants.

05:03.700 --> 05:07.370
[Shao's Residence]

05:09.420 --> 05:10.376
Sir, His Highness has never

05:10.400 --> 05:12.946
made such a request before.

05:12.970 --> 05:15.176
Is there anything fishy about this?

05:15.200 --> 05:16.970
What's more suspicious is that

05:17.200 --> 05:19.150
you agreed without any hesitation.

05:20.470 --> 05:22.680
Good. You've made some progress.

05:23.310 --> 05:24.546
Send my order.

05:24.570 --> 05:26.160
We'll do

05:26.470 --> 05:28.070
as His Highness said.

05:30.670 --> 05:31.506
Your Highness.

05:31.530 --> 05:33.100
They've left.

05:39.830 --> 05:41.280
Mr. Yun.

05:42.140 --> 05:44.120
Just as you predicted,

05:44.400 --> 05:46.370
he decided to do as I said.

05:47.510 --> 05:50.176
It's all because of

05:50.200 --> 05:51.436
Your Highness's eloquence.

05:51.460 --> 05:53.656
I didn't expect Nangong Fang

05:53.680 --> 05:55.610
would agree so easily.

05:57.350 --> 06:00.250
Nangong Fang may be despicable,

06:00.290 --> 06:01.986
but he has to obey

06:02.010 --> 06:03.500
my father's orders.

06:04.310 --> 06:06.036
But Nangong Fang...

06:06.060 --> 06:09.050
You wanted him to gather all his assets.

06:09.410 --> 06:10.586
What for?

06:10.610 --> 06:13.040
Nangong Fang has countless businesses.

06:13.090 --> 06:14.606
It will be time- and energy-consuming

06:14.630 --> 06:16.086
to tackle them one by one.

06:16.110 --> 06:18.100
Also, it'll be easy to alert Nangong Fang.

06:19.400 --> 06:20.526
I see.

06:20.550 --> 06:22.636
The process of gathering all his money

06:22.660 --> 06:23.966
to one place

06:23.990 --> 06:25.686
is very complicated.

06:25.710 --> 06:27.366
Nangong Fang needs to sort things out

06:27.390 --> 06:28.716
and keep a record.

06:28.740 --> 06:30.656
So, we just need to get this

06:30.680 --> 06:33.446
account book,

06:33.470 --> 06:36.380
and we can know all his businesses.

06:38.150 --> 06:39.600
This is a good idea.

06:39.890 --> 06:41.760
And it's easy to implement.

06:41.780 --> 06:43.816
Nangong Fang agreed to do so.

06:43.840 --> 06:45.256
But judging from his temperament,

06:45.280 --> 06:47.006
he will be fully prepared.

06:47.030 --> 06:48.786
If anything happens,

06:48.810 --> 06:50.156
he will destroy the evidence.

06:50.180 --> 06:54.050
It will be hard for us to find out his businesses then.

06:54.100 --> 06:57.590
So, we can only take this account book by strategy.

06:58.210 --> 06:59.646
We don't have to take it.

06:59.670 --> 07:01.120
There are other ways.

07:06.150 --> 07:07.670
Mr. Yun.

07:08.380 --> 07:10.356
Thank you for your help.

07:10.380 --> 07:12.406
But there's one thing I don't understand.

07:12.430 --> 07:15.406
If Nangong Fang is from Lingyuan Sect,

07:15.430 --> 07:17.900
aren't you afraid of his revenge?

07:18.270 --> 07:19.626
It's my honor

07:19.650 --> 07:21.430
to share your burden.

07:21.690 --> 07:22.816
I hope you

07:22.840 --> 07:24.916
can fulfill my wish

07:24.940 --> 07:27.700
as we agreed.

07:28.470 --> 07:29.920
Don't worry.

07:30.000 --> 07:32.640
I've always kept my word.

07:34.350 --> 07:35.646
But Yun Xiang,

07:35.670 --> 07:38.336
Nangong Fang must be fully prepared.

07:38.360 --> 07:40.360
Are you sure you want to go alone?

07:41.360 --> 07:42.796
Don't worry.

07:42.820 --> 07:45.620
I have a perfect candidate to go with me.

07:45.720 --> 07:48.326
You want me to go to Yangzhou with you?

07:48.350 --> 07:49.116
Yes.

07:49.140 --> 07:51.266
Do you really think I don't know about

07:51.290 --> 07:52.746
what happened in Guanghui Bank last night?

07:52.770 --> 07:55.376
You can't deal with Nangong Fang in Nandu.

07:55.400 --> 07:57.600
And now you're going to his base.

07:59.210 --> 08:02.610
In a crisis, we should try to win with unexpected methods.

08:03.090 --> 08:04.630
I have a plan.

08:04.930 --> 08:06.380
It's risky.

08:06.690 --> 08:07.676
But if it works,

08:07.700 --> 08:10.450
we'll defeat Nangong Fang once and for all

08:10.780 --> 08:12.750
and make sure you can become the next

08:12.770 --> 08:14.460
Lingyuan Sect's master.

08:14.910 --> 08:16.550
But for this plan to work,

08:16.820 --> 08:18.720
I need your help.

08:20.360 --> 08:21.636
Tell me about

08:21.660 --> 08:24.190
how to make me the next master.

08:24.950 --> 08:27.956
First, we need to find out what businesses Nangong Fang has

08:27.980 --> 08:30.086
in Yangzhou and even the entire Jiangnan.

08:30.110 --> 08:31.166
If you can control

08:31.190 --> 08:33.100
all his businesses

08:33.380 --> 08:36.319
and hand them over to Madam Kou,

08:36.520 --> 08:39.300
what kind of feat will it be?

08:49.090 --> 08:51.080
What's the plan?

08:51.670 --> 08:53.120
Tell me about it.

08:59.460 --> 09:02.580
This is the situation you want.

09:03.560 --> 09:05.270
What's your next plan?

09:05.460 --> 09:08.190
Take a rest and wait.

09:08.290 --> 09:10.850
Based on your understanding of Yun Xiang,

09:11.580 --> 09:13.770
what will he do next?

09:14.200 --> 09:16.730
He's good at turning failure into success.

09:17.260 --> 09:19.526
He's unpredictable.

09:19.550 --> 09:21.670
His opponents are often caught off guard.

09:21.910 --> 09:24.206
Turning failure into success?

09:24.230 --> 09:26.710
It sounds intimidating.

09:27.230 --> 09:29.226
I can only stay put.

09:29.250 --> 09:32.010
I'll deal with him when he makes moves.

09:35.590 --> 09:37.040
I'm waiting.

09:38.020 --> 09:42.050
You must be waiting too.

09:42.770 --> 09:44.320
Mr. Nangong.

09:44.870 --> 09:46.786
Stop talking nonsense.

09:46.810 --> 09:48.206
Aren't you waiting

09:48.230 --> 09:50.086
for Madam Kou's reply?

09:50.110 --> 09:51.650
Don't blabber.

09:54.770 --> 09:56.256
To be honest,

09:56.280 --> 09:59.206
even if you tell Madam Kou my every move,

09:59.230 --> 10:00.550
and even if she knows

10:00.570 --> 10:03.050
I allied with Prince Fu,

10:03.670 --> 10:05.300
so what?

10:20.070 --> 10:21.520
Uncle.

10:22.230 --> 10:23.056
What?

10:23.080 --> 10:24.950
People are here to recover their debts?

10:25.020 --> 10:25.816
No.

10:25.840 --> 10:27.386
Master summoned us urgently,

10:27.410 --> 10:29.900
demanding we go back now.

10:30.760 --> 10:32.756
How many secret reports did I send him?

10:32.780 --> 10:34.326
He didn't reply.

10:34.350 --> 10:35.716
As soon as something happened to Guanghui Bank,

10:35.740 --> 10:37.206
he wanted me to go back to punish me?

10:37.230 --> 10:38.446
No.

10:38.470 --> 10:39.916
Let's go, uncle.

10:39.940 --> 10:41.216
Don't be so petulant.

10:41.240 --> 10:42.126
If we're late,

10:42.150 --> 10:43.596
it'll be harder to explain to Master.

10:43.620 --> 10:46.540
Hurry up. Let's go.

10:46.710 --> 10:47.766
Master urgently summoned us.

10:47.790 --> 10:49.496
Kang Qiao and I will go back to Yuntai first.

10:49.520 --> 10:50.970
Take care.

11:09.050 --> 11:10.026
I was asked to protect you.

11:10.050 --> 11:11.486
But I always can't find you.

11:11.510 --> 11:12.786
If you die,

11:12.810 --> 11:13.610
should I return

11:13.630 --> 11:15.220
the gold she gave me or not?

11:15.770 --> 11:17.016
Jin,

11:17.040 --> 11:18.800
would you like to drink with me?

11:20.470 --> 11:21.920
Didn't you quit drinking?

11:22.380 --> 11:23.970
Today is special.

11:29.100 --> 11:30.640
Cut to the chase.

11:31.090 --> 11:32.810
What's going on?

11:38.000 --> 11:40.420
Are you willing to risk your life with me?

11:43.470 --> 11:44.996
You're quite straightforward this time.

11:45.020 --> 11:46.006
Make it clear.

11:46.030 --> 11:47.550
Why are we risking our lives?

11:48.350 --> 11:50.030
I need to go to Yangzhou.

11:50.810 --> 11:52.830
This trip is going to be very dangerous.

11:53.080 --> 11:54.950
I wanted to bring Kang Qiao.

11:55.320 --> 11:57.676
But he and Mr. Mo have left Nandu.

11:57.700 --> 11:59.190
So, I had no choice but to come to you.

11:59.210 --> 12:00.326
Cut the crap.

12:00.350 --> 12:01.016
Since we're risking lives,

12:01.040 --> 12:02.490
who can be faster than me in swordsmanship?

12:04.180 --> 12:07.080
But you have attachments now.

12:07.870 --> 12:10.286
If you don't want to go, I won't force you.

12:10.310 --> 12:12.796
Maybe I can find more escorts.

12:12.820 --> 12:14.270
Come on.

12:14.880 --> 12:16.330
How about this?

12:18.990 --> 12:21.360
Tell me

12:21.550 --> 12:22.856
all your secrets.

12:22.880 --> 12:23.866
If you can't,

12:23.890 --> 12:25.340
then entrust your life

12:25.460 --> 12:27.370
to those escorts.

12:28.900 --> 12:30.166
My secrets can't be explained

12:30.190 --> 12:32.830
within a few cups of liquor.

12:33.280 --> 12:33.926
Wait.

12:33.950 --> 12:35.570
I'll get two more jars.

12:53.000 --> 12:54.450
I'm done.

12:54.950 --> 12:56.860
We have to hit the road tomorrow.

12:58.690 --> 12:59.936
So, you agreed?

12:59.960 --> 13:01.256
Now you know

13:01.280 --> 13:03.336
the whole story.

13:03.360 --> 13:05.526
You should be aware of

13:05.550 --> 13:07.100
how dangerous this trip is.

13:09.900 --> 13:12.016
I knew you have secrets.

13:12.040 --> 13:14.780
I didn't expect so many.

13:16.820 --> 13:18.710
Your surname should be Luo.

13:19.770 --> 13:21.220
Yes.

13:22.110 --> 13:23.560
My name is Luo Wenjia.

13:28.340 --> 13:30.000
When can we come back

13:30.480 --> 13:31.950
from Yangzhou?

13:33.070 --> 13:34.686
If it goes well,

13:34.710 --> 13:36.086
we can be back in three days.

13:36.110 --> 13:37.560
Fine.

13:37.860 --> 13:40.290
Ten taels of gold a day.

13:40.480 --> 13:41.960
Shouldn't it be

13:41.980 --> 13:43.086
10 taels of gold every mission?

13:43.110 --> 13:44.720
You can't find swordsmen easily nowadays.

13:44.900 --> 13:46.680
Can't I increase the price?

13:49.270 --> 13:50.720
Of course you can.

13:53.900 --> 13:55.350
Deal.

14:10.980 --> 14:12.356
It has been a long tour.

14:12.380 --> 14:14.300
Did you find anything this time?

14:15.280 --> 14:16.236
Yes.

14:16.260 --> 14:18.550
Let's meet Yun Xiang later.

14:18.620 --> 14:21.130
Yun Xiang left the city with his swordsman.

14:21.940 --> 14:23.236
Where did they go?

14:23.260 --> 14:24.606
The people around him are very discreet.

14:24.630 --> 14:26.080
I haven't found their whereabouts yet.

14:26.820 --> 14:29.926
After I entered the city,

14:29.950 --> 14:31.880
I noticed that everyone's talking about Guanghui Bank.

14:31.940 --> 14:32.776
Yes.

14:32.800 --> 14:33.936
Because of the bank run,

14:33.960 --> 14:35.406
Guanghui Bank went bankrupt overnight.

14:35.430 --> 14:37.140
Mo Bufan has gone missing.

14:37.280 --> 14:38.626
The Su family was also deeply implicated

14:38.650 --> 14:40.100
and suffered huge losses.

14:40.190 --> 14:41.586
Any other information?

14:41.610 --> 14:43.460
On the night Prince Fu arrived in Nandu,

14:43.590 --> 14:45.240
he was almost assassinated.

14:45.460 --> 14:46.700
The assassin was the woman of Lingyuan

14:46.720 --> 14:48.396
who was imprisoned.

14:48.420 --> 14:49.870
What about Princess...

14:52.320 --> 14:54.020
How are Princess and Prince?

14:54.080 --> 14:55.276
Are they hurt?

14:55.300 --> 14:57.480
They are safe and sound.

14:57.520 --> 14:59.500
The suspect is injured.

14:59.580 --> 15:01.460
Without help,

15:02.120 --> 15:04.290
how could she escape from the prison?

15:04.390 --> 15:05.940
Has Yun Xiang been there?

15:06.280 --> 15:09.940
Before the incident, Yun Xiang went to Shao's Residence to look for Princess.

15:10.350 --> 15:12.850
Magistrate Shao was there at that time.

15:13.870 --> 15:14.990
You can tell me about

15:14.990 --> 15:16.726
what you know later.

15:16.750 --> 15:18.746
There is an urgent matter at hand.

15:18.770 --> 15:19.916
It can't be delayed.

15:19.940 --> 15:21.660
I'll give you seven names.

15:21.780 --> 15:23.406
They are all officials who have retired from the Censorate.

15:23.430 --> 15:25.580
Go and find out how they are doing.

15:36.590 --> 15:37.316
Uncle,

15:37.340 --> 15:39.740
have you figured out how to explain to Master?

15:40.970 --> 15:42.506
Even if I can come up with 10,000 solutions,

15:42.530 --> 15:43.956
I can't fool him.

15:43.980 --> 15:46.976
I'd better play it by ear and pray for good luck.

15:47.000 --> 15:48.450
Mo.

15:51.680 --> 15:53.046
Yuechen.

15:52.620 --> 15:54.820
[Yuntai Sect Gu Yuechen]

15:57.870 --> 15:59.206
Yuechen.

15:59.230 --> 16:00.806
Aren't you in Huizhou?

16:00.830 --> 16:02.356
I was summoned by Master,

16:02.380 --> 16:03.516
so I hurried back.

16:03.540 --> 16:05.946
Were other disciples summoned back too?

16:05.970 --> 16:08.036
I heard that Qin Shiyi in Yuezhou,

16:08.060 --> 16:10.410
Wu Shizhi in Zhangzhou, and others all received an urgent call.

16:10.790 --> 16:12.656
It's been years since the last time

16:12.680 --> 16:14.360
we had such a meeting.

16:15.120 --> 16:17.336
I thought I was summoned back

16:17.360 --> 16:19.230
because I made a mistake.

16:20.020 --> 16:21.590
It has been so many years.

16:22.650 --> 16:24.006
Mr. Mo is back.

16:24.030 --> 16:25.480
Mr. Mo.

16:25.800 --> 16:27.196
You're all here.

16:27.220 --> 16:28.670
Mr. Mo.

16:31.910 --> 16:33.360
Kang Qiao.

16:33.450 --> 16:34.816
Master.

16:34.840 --> 16:35.726
After so many years.

16:35.750 --> 16:37.770
Greetings, Master.

16:41.620 --> 16:43.980
[Yanwu Master Zhong Beidou]

16:41.920 --> 16:43.560
Good! Good!

16:43.760 --> 16:46.960
You still speak and behave just as you did.

16:47.330 --> 16:52.570
I'm afraid you'll become too slippery because of him.

16:52.680 --> 16:53.846
You old monster.

16:53.870 --> 16:55.006
After so many years,

16:55.030 --> 16:56.950
you are still so mean.

16:57.620 --> 16:59.070
Let me ask you.

16:59.770 --> 17:02.366
Why did Master summon us back so urgently?

17:02.390 --> 17:04.190
Did anything happen?

17:05.910 --> 17:09.010
All disciples across the country are coming back one after another.

17:09.969 --> 17:11.780
There must be something big.

17:14.090 --> 17:15.846
It is said that

17:15.870 --> 17:19.090
we can see Master's face.

17:20.370 --> 17:25.820
[Yangzhou Pier]

17:27.360 --> 17:30.760
The trip from Yangzhou to Nandu

17:31.300 --> 17:32.876
was so dangerous.

17:32.900 --> 17:34.650
It's funny though.

17:35.110 --> 17:37.830
The Cao Sect that tried to kill you

17:37.880 --> 17:39.650
is now used by you.

17:41.410 --> 17:42.826
Did you agree to come with me

17:42.850 --> 17:43.730
because you were drunk last night?

17:43.750 --> 17:44.596
Nonsense.

17:44.620 --> 17:46.070
We're halfway there.

17:46.260 --> 17:47.970
Why are you still hesitating?

17:50.650 --> 17:52.440
Have you ever calculated

17:52.540 --> 17:54.260
how much gold I gave you

17:54.560 --> 17:56.340
since we met,

17:56.580 --> 17:58.580
considering you've helped me so many times?

17:59.480 --> 18:01.360
You think I don't know?

18:01.550 --> 18:03.690
You gave me 30 taels at the very first.

18:03.920 --> 18:05.806
Since then,

18:05.830 --> 18:07.590
you've never given me a penny.

18:08.020 --> 18:09.806
You seem careless.

18:09.830 --> 18:11.470
But actually, you remember everything.

18:14.980 --> 18:17.610
I've seen shameless people like you.

18:18.190 --> 18:19.546
But I've never met anyone

18:19.570 --> 18:21.160
who's shameless but not obnoxious

18:21.310 --> 18:24.230
other than you.

18:25.200 --> 18:26.650
I'm flattered.

18:26.940 --> 18:28.390
But don't worry.

18:28.460 --> 18:29.686
I'll pay you

18:29.710 --> 18:31.320
this time.

18:31.700 --> 18:33.150
You...

18:33.790 --> 18:36.376
You always appear to be cunning

18:36.400 --> 18:38.110
and afraid of opening your heart to others.

18:38.830 --> 18:40.630
I didn't understand you before.

18:40.740 --> 18:43.900
But I knew although you're ruthless and brutal,

18:44.620 --> 18:46.540
you never hurt your friends.

18:47.020 --> 18:48.846
After knowing your sad life last night,

18:48.870 --> 18:51.200
I realized why you disguised yourself in this way.

18:52.650 --> 18:54.100
Your heart

18:54.920 --> 18:56.570
is still warm.

18:59.590 --> 19:00.986
Trust me.

19:01.010 --> 19:03.620
I've never misjudged people.

19:04.810 --> 19:06.676
Only after I met you did I realize that

19:06.700 --> 19:09.926
there is loyalty towards friends in this world.

19:09.950 --> 19:11.286
Fine.

19:11.310 --> 19:13.370
Don't say those cheesy words.

19:15.180 --> 19:17.860
From now on,

19:18.110 --> 19:19.096
be honest with me.

19:19.120 --> 19:20.570
Say what you want to say.

19:20.720 --> 19:22.496
Don't try to trick me.

19:22.520 --> 19:24.006
Okay, I promise.

19:24.030 --> 19:26.310
How? Tell me now.

19:28.590 --> 19:30.466
How about we become sworn brothers?

19:30.490 --> 19:31.940
You are my elder brother.

19:32.130 --> 19:33.610
I'll buy you a drink after we come back.

19:42.660 --> 19:44.550
Is he that girl's younger brother?

19:46.270 --> 19:47.720
What's his name again?

19:47.830 --> 19:50.520
Young Master of Lingyuan Sect, Kou Yuanjie.

19:51.470 --> 19:53.910
We need to make an alliance with him for our mission.

19:53.950 --> 19:55.566
But you must be careful.

19:55.590 --> 19:57.526
He is also the greatest danger during this journey.

19:57.550 --> 19:58.506
Don't worry.

19:58.530 --> 20:00.440
He can't hurt you under my watch.

20:02.970 --> 20:04.966
Look at him.

20:04.990 --> 20:06.860
He doesn't look like his sister at all.

20:08.910 --> 20:10.786
If that girl has a sister

20:10.810 --> 20:12.370
instead of a brother,

20:12.930 --> 20:14.510
do you need me to protect you this time?

20:15.560 --> 20:16.956
I don't want to talk to you about this.

20:16.980 --> 20:18.430
You don't understand.

20:18.950 --> 20:19.996
I didn't.

20:20.020 --> 20:21.470
But I'm different now.

20:34.630 --> 20:39.630
[Yangzhou City]

20:42.460 --> 20:43.996
We just want to find a place to stay.

20:44.020 --> 20:45.626
What are you doing wandering

20:45.650 --> 20:47.100
in these alleys off the beaten track?

20:47.350 --> 20:49.086
Spies of Nangong Fang

20:49.110 --> 20:50.976
are all over the bustling places in Yangzhou.

20:51.000 --> 20:52.016
We can't go to those places.

20:52.040 --> 20:53.520
Is it safe here?

20:54.240 --> 20:55.576
I more or less know

20:55.600 --> 20:57.380
his deployment in Yangzhou.

20:57.420 --> 20:59.520
This road is absolutely safe.

20:59.910 --> 21:01.630
You have your own informants?

21:02.350 --> 21:06.230
Otherwise, why did Mr. Yun bring me along?

21:11.140 --> 21:12.590
Here we are.

21:21.350 --> 21:22.796
It's a bit shabby.

21:22.820 --> 21:24.270
Hope you don't mind.

21:24.300 --> 21:26.540
It's okay. This is only for a temporary stay.

21:27.790 --> 21:29.240
Shall we take action tonight?

21:29.950 --> 21:31.400
Let's wait.

21:31.460 --> 21:33.170
Let's figure out what's going on first.

21:33.620 --> 21:35.216
Then eat and drink

21:35.240 --> 21:36.710
to refresh.

21:50.650 --> 21:52.100
Here.

21:55.340 --> 21:56.790
You have liquor here?

21:57.750 --> 21:59.476
I have safehouses

21:59.500 --> 22:01.526
in every city of Jiangbei,

22:01.550 --> 22:03.246
each with different uses.

22:03.270 --> 22:07.520
But one thing in common is that I have good liquor there.

22:12.740 --> 22:14.190
Cheers.

22:29.730 --> 22:31.180
By the way,

22:31.740 --> 22:32.586
you only told me

22:32.610 --> 22:35.676
Nangong Fang would gather money from his businesses

22:35.700 --> 22:39.220
but you didn't tell me where the money would go.

22:40.180 --> 22:42.330
This is the first thing I need to find out.

22:42.360 --> 22:44.360
Do you have any connections? No, thank you.

22:45.800 --> 22:47.270
It's not difficult.

22:48.210 --> 22:50.970
I'll get some rest and contact my informant.

23:05.720 --> 23:07.550
He left alone.

23:07.590 --> 23:09.230
Will he play tricks?

23:10.690 --> 23:13.100
Are you going to drink all the liquor here?

23:14.240 --> 23:15.690
Don't worry.

23:16.360 --> 23:17.890
I've observed him carefully.

23:18.190 --> 23:19.896
His martial arts skills are ordinary.

23:19.920 --> 23:21.466
Even if I get drunk,

23:21.490 --> 23:23.380
I can take him down in three moves.

23:24.590 --> 23:26.040
Don't forget the people of the Lingyuan Sect

23:26.150 --> 23:28.700
are best at using poison.

23:44.240 --> 23:45.770
Can this work?

23:46.350 --> 23:49.110
It should be able to detoxify all the poison of Lingyuan Sect.

24:00.470 --> 24:01.920
It's settled.

24:01.990 --> 24:02.996
The spy I planted

24:03.020 --> 24:04.910
around Nangong Fang is called Yan San.

24:04.960 --> 24:07.076
We'll meet here tomorrow morning.

24:07.100 --> 24:08.216
It went so smoothly?

24:08.240 --> 24:09.036
Yun.

24:09.060 --> 24:10.356
If this works out well,

24:10.380 --> 24:11.906
I should thank you.

24:11.930 --> 24:13.136
I hope you can leave Nangong Fang to me

24:13.160 --> 24:15.260
as you promised.

24:15.910 --> 24:17.360
Of course.

24:18.210 --> 24:19.660
All these years, I've been helping my mother

24:20.250 --> 24:22.836
supervise the internal affairs of the sect.

24:22.860 --> 24:24.196
My sister has been traveling around

24:24.220 --> 24:25.526
to look for talents and secret techniques,

24:25.550 --> 24:28.346
hoping to find a solution one day

24:28.370 --> 24:30.520
to deal with Nangong Fang.

24:31.190 --> 24:33.830
That day will come soon.

24:37.590 --> 24:39.040
By the way, Yun,

24:39.410 --> 24:41.640
by helping me,

24:42.120 --> 24:44.330
you are saving

24:44.350 --> 24:45.920
Lingyuan Sect from misery.

24:46.620 --> 24:48.646
Then why don't we take the opportunity to break the division

24:48.670 --> 24:50.250
between Lingyuan and Yuntai?

24:50.660 --> 24:53.046
My sister loves you so much.

24:53.070 --> 24:55.426
Then you can be together

24:55.450 --> 24:57.010
after we are reconciled.

24:59.030 --> 25:00.940
Do you have to rub it in?

25:01.100 --> 25:02.176
Come here.

25:02.200 --> 25:03.960
Drink more and talk less.

25:04.270 --> 25:05.720
Here.

25:56.430 --> 25:57.880
Young Master.

25:58.190 --> 25:58.966
Have a seat.

25:58.990 --> 26:00.440
Yes.

26:06.510 --> 26:08.980
It seems Nangong has treated you well.

26:10.070 --> 26:11.566
Thanks to you,

26:11.590 --> 26:14.390
I can get two salaries.

26:16.640 --> 26:18.730
This is for your tip-off last time.

26:23.220 --> 26:26.946
I heard that Nangong Fang is collecting money.

26:26.970 --> 26:28.420
Is that true?

26:28.850 --> 26:31.246
Where is he sending the money?

26:31.270 --> 26:33.570
Young Master, to Nandu.

26:34.320 --> 26:35.770
No way.

26:36.080 --> 26:38.900
I heard that before he sends the money to Nandu,

26:38.990 --> 26:41.410
he should pool it in one place first.

26:49.230 --> 26:51.326
Thank you, Young Master. I shouldn't stay too long.

26:51.350 --> 26:52.736
So...

26:52.760 --> 26:55.050
Human nature is really unpredictable.

26:55.320 --> 26:57.846
Do you really regard Nangong Fang as your master?

26:57.870 --> 26:59.466
We grew up together

26:59.490 --> 27:00.876
and practiced martial arts together.

27:00.900 --> 27:04.370
Are you leaving the friendship behind?

27:04.570 --> 27:05.596
I heard

27:05.620 --> 27:08.610
your seal was taken away by Madam Kou.

27:10.250 --> 27:11.790
So what?

27:12.140 --> 27:13.590
Actually, it doesn't matter.

27:13.720 --> 27:17.070
But even if you have the seal,

27:17.260 --> 27:18.806
I'm afraid you have no right

27:18.830 --> 27:20.990
to know information about Mr. Nangong.

27:24.630 --> 27:26.456
Please don't make it difficult for me.

27:26.480 --> 27:27.696
I'll leave now.

27:27.720 --> 27:31.030
I won't tell anyone about this.

27:33.310 --> 27:36.870
Can you leave?

27:37.180 --> 27:38.780
I shall take my leave.

27:55.460 --> 27:57.320
Can you leave?

27:58.930 --> 28:00.256
Young Master.

28:00.280 --> 28:00.846
Young Master.

28:00.870 --> 28:02.406
Mr. Yun, please wait a moment.

28:02.430 --> 28:04.086
We'll find out very soon.

28:04.110 --> 28:06.270
Please spare my life, Young Master.

28:06.270 --> 28:08.670
I'll tell you everything.

28:21.870 --> 28:23.286
That brat

28:23.310 --> 28:24.760
is really scary.

28:50.750 --> 28:53.680
Your Highness, you came to Su's Residence

28:54.070 --> 28:55.870
with these banknotes today.

28:56.080 --> 28:58.480
I'm confused.

28:58.550 --> 28:59.776
Don't be so reserved.

28:59.800 --> 29:01.250
Sit down and then we can talk.

29:04.840 --> 29:07.180
There were many misunderstandings about what happened before.

29:07.360 --> 29:08.776
After thinking about it,

29:08.800 --> 29:10.436
my father thinks the Su family

29:10.460 --> 29:12.780
is the best candidate to be the royal supplier.

29:12.840 --> 29:15.006
So, he asked me to send these banknotes

29:15.030 --> 29:18.180
to help the Su family in the selection.

29:18.280 --> 29:19.246
Your Highness.

29:19.270 --> 29:20.766
We've heard that

29:20.790 --> 29:22.176
it is your father

29:22.200 --> 29:24.180
who got those two royal decrees.

29:24.550 --> 29:25.936
Although we are just humble businesspeople,

29:25.960 --> 29:29.640
we don't want to be manipulated.

29:30.180 --> 29:32.520
I'm sure we have to return the money one day

29:33.350 --> 29:36.370
if we accept it today.

29:43.180 --> 29:44.630
Your Highness,

29:44.780 --> 29:47.220
I apologize for what we said just now.

29:47.440 --> 29:50.610
But I really don't understand your intentions.

29:50.810 --> 29:52.166
I dare not

29:52.190 --> 29:54.580
accept this money.

30:02.130 --> 30:05.010
You two have your pride.

30:05.290 --> 30:08.010
No wonder Yun Xiang wants to help you.

30:08.560 --> 30:09.676
To be honest,

30:09.700 --> 30:10.706
it is my father

30:10.730 --> 30:12.600
who got those two royal decrees.

30:12.980 --> 30:15.566
He wanted to find a place in the business world of Nandu.

30:15.590 --> 30:17.246
Unfortunately, he trusted the wrong person.

30:17.270 --> 30:18.806
Therefore, he had to change plans.

30:18.830 --> 30:21.746
You just said that this has something to do with Yun?

30:21.770 --> 30:22.866
That's right.

30:22.890 --> 30:26.070
Young Master Xiang is helping my father solve a problem.

30:26.520 --> 30:27.876
The reward he wants

30:27.900 --> 30:30.950
is to let my father help the Su family get through this.

30:31.740 --> 30:34.510
You just need to prepare for the royal supplier selection carefully.

30:34.860 --> 30:36.930
Tell me if you need help.

30:37.120 --> 30:38.476
But remember,

30:38.500 --> 30:40.910
don't tell anyone about this.

30:41.200 --> 30:42.650
Your Highness,

30:43.490 --> 30:46.820
what deal did Yun make with your father?

30:46.870 --> 30:48.226
Is it dangerous?

30:48.250 --> 30:51.300
You'd better not know about this.

31:04.590 --> 31:07.580
Why does Princess Mingzhu's visit to Su's Residence

31:07.890 --> 31:09.846
make you so nervous?

31:09.870 --> 31:11.490
Can't you tell what's going on

31:11.580 --> 31:13.300
or are you playing dumb with me?

31:13.380 --> 31:16.570
Has Princess Mingzhu been in touch with the Su family?

31:18.700 --> 31:21.880
Her visit to Su's Residence is definitely Prince Fu's idea.

31:22.070 --> 31:24.516
Prince Fu asked for royal decrees to suppress the Su family.

31:24.540 --> 31:26.290
But now he's supporting the Su family.

31:26.320 --> 31:27.646
Aren't you worried

31:27.670 --> 31:29.680
that Prince Fu is giving you up?

31:33.180 --> 31:35.800
This reminds me of something.

31:37.790 --> 31:40.046
Prince Fu had never asked about the process

31:40.070 --> 31:42.640
but only cared about the result when he wanted me to mobilize funds.

31:42.910 --> 31:45.386
But this time, he said that he wanted me to keep a low profile,

31:45.410 --> 31:48.210
so I can only use the spare money I have.

31:48.640 --> 31:51.286
What if his true purpose

31:51.310 --> 31:52.760
is to find out

31:54.550 --> 31:57.500
how many businesses I have?

31:57.910 --> 32:00.190
If you lose control of these businesses,

32:00.590 --> 32:04.540
Prince Fu will not be the only one to trouble you.

32:07.680 --> 32:09.130
When did you send the order?

32:10.670 --> 32:12.120
The day before yesterday.

32:12.180 --> 32:14.316
I'm afraid the money

32:14.340 --> 32:16.086
has been gathered together.

32:16.110 --> 32:17.236
Nangong Fang,

32:17.260 --> 32:18.796
I've warned you.

32:18.820 --> 32:20.316
Then who's the one that used Bi Yuewu

32:20.340 --> 32:22.240
to lure the official soldier to me?

32:25.200 --> 32:28.290
There is only one way now.

32:39.100 --> 32:41.406
Please take my token

32:41.430 --> 32:42.846
and go to Yangzhou immediately.

32:42.870 --> 32:46.046
Destroy all the accounts

32:46.070 --> 32:47.520
involving this transfer.

32:47.860 --> 32:51.840
Datong Firm, Jinfeng Street, west of Yangzhou.

32:56.600 --> 32:57.506
Sir,

32:57.530 --> 33:00.200
once they find out the businesses you have,

33:01.120 --> 33:02.570
I'm afraid...

33:02.730 --> 33:05.410
I was just thinking about how to send her away.

33:06.350 --> 33:08.000
The result is certain.

33:10.030 --> 33:11.730
We can't stay in Nandu for long.

33:12.350 --> 33:13.996
While she is not here,

33:14.020 --> 33:15.840
we should pack up

33:16.550 --> 33:17.836
and leave.

33:17.410 --> 33:22.870
[Yangzhou Datong Firm]

33:26.460 --> 33:28.026
It's almost dawn.

33:28.050 --> 33:29.526
Why aren't the next shift here yet?

33:29.550 --> 33:31.070
Who knows?

33:31.110 --> 33:33.956
Since Yan San came here,

33:33.980 --> 33:35.846
the rules are getting messier.

33:35.870 --> 33:36.550
Don't mention it.

33:36.550 --> 33:37.830
He must have gone out

33:37.830 --> 33:38.926
to have fun today.

33:38.950 --> 33:40.056
When Mr. Nangong comes back,

33:40.080 --> 33:41.366
we have to tell on him.

33:41.390 --> 33:43.710
Yes, tell on him.

34:32.390 --> 34:33.930
You don't know martial arts at all?

34:50.049 --> 34:51.846
Did you memorize all the names in the account book?

34:51.870 --> 34:53.025
There are dozens of them.

34:53.049 --> 34:54.060
Don't talk to me.

34:54.080 --> 34:54.910
You know there are dozens of names.

34:54.910 --> 34:56.669
What if I forget?

34:58.500 --> 34:59.950
Let's go.

35:10.780 --> 35:11.526
Jin.

35:11.550 --> 35:13.000
Get me a brush and paper.

35:14.480 --> 35:15.266
Warrior Jin.

35:15.290 --> 35:17.360
The brushes and paper are in the cabinet. Get them quickly.

36:00.190 --> 36:01.870
Go get help.

36:10.820 --> 36:11.966
Are you sure they are correct?

36:11.990 --> 36:13.440
Of course.

36:14.050 --> 36:17.220
Great.

36:17.350 --> 36:18.826
It won't take me long

36:18.850 --> 36:20.686
to make

36:20.710 --> 36:22.310
Nangong Fang's life hell.

36:23.030 --> 36:25.400
I hope you can keep your promise.

36:28.110 --> 36:30.230
You want me to keep my promise?

36:30.270 --> 36:31.720
What about you?

36:32.100 --> 36:33.116
What do you mean?

36:33.140 --> 36:35.360
Do you really think I'm a fool?

36:36.010 --> 36:38.366
How did you know

36:38.390 --> 36:40.160
that Nangong Fang is raising money?

36:41.550 --> 36:44.876
You've been in close contact with Prince Fu,

36:44.900 --> 36:47.890
Princess Mingzhu, and that so-called Detective of Jiangnan these days.

36:47.940 --> 36:50.280
You got the information from them, right?

36:50.310 --> 36:52.296
Then, you used me to lead the way

36:52.320 --> 36:54.140
and get this list.

36:55.700 --> 36:57.410
This is the only copy of the list.

36:57.530 --> 36:58.400
Now you have it.

36:58.420 --> 37:00.030
There's another copy

37:00.920 --> 37:02.730
in your head.

37:08.770 --> 37:09.736
Jin.

37:09.760 --> 37:11.210
You don't need to kill him.

37:11.310 --> 37:12.760
Just knock him out.

37:15.540 --> 37:16.990
Jin.

37:17.410 --> 37:18.436
Ten Taels of Gold.

37:18.460 --> 37:20.910
Roll up your sleeves and show him.

37:26.400 --> 37:27.850
Heart Devouring Powder.

37:28.630 --> 37:31.570
Tang Xiao's pharmacopoeia is amazing.

37:32.050 --> 37:34.446
It's just that the ingredients needed are too rare.

37:34.470 --> 37:36.596
So, I didn't have time to prepare one for you too.

37:36.620 --> 37:38.656
In order to make sure nothing goes wrong,

37:38.680 --> 37:39.926
I ordered Ten Taels of Gold

37:39.950 --> 37:41.626
to leave traces along the way on purpose

37:41.650 --> 37:43.850
so that Nangong Fang's men can find this place.

37:44.460 --> 37:46.246
But to my surprise,

37:46.270 --> 37:48.466
you don't know martial arts at all.

37:48.490 --> 37:51.190
Looks like my preparations are unnecessary.

37:59.070 --> 38:01.310
Ten Taels of Gold, kill him

38:01.430 --> 38:02.676
and then kill yourself.

38:02.700 --> 38:04.320
Yes, Master.

38:30.490 --> 38:32.006
I still fell into his trap.

38:32.030 --> 38:33.830
This poison is so strange.

38:33.980 --> 38:34.996
I can hear and see.

38:35.020 --> 38:36.650
But I can't control my body.

38:37.980 --> 38:39.430
Luckily, you're agile.

38:43.250 --> 38:44.700
Jin.

38:47.720 --> 38:50.680
Didn't you say Dingyuan Pill can detoxify all poisons?

38:51.200 --> 38:54.240
My internal organs are burning.

38:54.510 --> 38:56.226
I don't think it can detoxify Heart Devouring Powder.

38:56.250 --> 38:57.766
It can only help you calm yourself.

38:57.790 --> 38:58.936
How long can it last?

38:58.960 --> 39:00.410
I don't know.

39:01.110 --> 39:02.706
Could it be that Tang Xiao

39:02.730 --> 39:04.286
gave you poison instead of Dingyuan Pill?

39:04.310 --> 39:07.910
Radix Scutellariae, Rhizoma Anemarrhenae, Cortex Phellodendri,

39:11.290 --> 39:12.740
Arctium lappa, and Rhododendron molle.

39:14.510 --> 39:15.386
This isn't right.

39:15.410 --> 39:16.806
When Tianhu was poisoned,

39:16.830 --> 39:18.616
her symptoms were not as serious as mine.

39:18.640 --> 39:19.706
Stop talking.

39:19.730 --> 39:20.926
I remember the formula of the antidote.

39:20.950 --> 39:22.660
I'll take you to get the medicine now.

39:55.100 --> 39:57.060
They got here pretty fast.

40:02.790 --> 40:03.956
I'll get the medicine.

40:03.980 --> 40:05.660
Get rid of them as soon as possible.

40:08.110 --> 40:09.560
Go!

40:45.660 --> 40:50.040
[Chunming Gate]

40:54.340 --> 40:56.140
Doctor, please hurry up.

40:56.840 --> 40:58.226
These herbs are highly poisonous.

40:58.250 --> 40:59.850
They need to be decocted for two hours.

41:01.760 --> 41:04.130
[Medicine]

41:12.770 --> 41:16.150
Kill him and then kill yourself.

41:16.430 --> 41:19.540
Kill him and then kill yourself.

41:20.970 --> 41:22.560
Kill him.

42:53.990 --> 42:57.056
Kill him and then kill yourself.

42:57.080 --> 43:00.960
Kill him and then kill yourself.

43:03.510 --> 43:06.910
Kill him and then kill yourself.

43:12.550 --> 43:14.440
Jin, how are you?

43:15.430 --> 43:16.416
Where is the antidote?

43:16.440 --> 43:18.720
I can't hold on any longer.

43:18.910 --> 43:19.670
I've got the medicine.

43:19.670 --> 43:21.120
Hang in there.

43:21.430 --> 43:22.880
Stand up.

43:27.630 --> 43:29.326
Our men are waiting for us at the pier ahead.

43:29.350 --> 43:30.386
Don't use your internal force.

43:30.410 --> 43:32.530
Otherwise, the poison will spread faster.

43:33.050 --> 43:34.396
If I don't use the internal force,

43:34.420 --> 43:35.926
should we just wait for being chopped into pieces?

43:35.950 --> 43:37.630
Stop talking.

43:40.350 --> 43:41.956
Jin, hold on.

43:41.980 --> 43:43.430
Kill him!

43:49.630 --> 43:51.080
Jin!

43:54.490 --> 43:55.940
Jin!

43:56.700 --> 43:58.380
Control yourself.
